## Axiom audit

```
> lake env lean ../../../data/raw/lean_chipcut_wire_corecomb_cbs_v4_20261122/axioms.lean
EXIT=0    WALL=2.2 s
```
Output in `axioms.txt` (round 2 adds the `AbsInv` chain, `chipRel_absChip`,
`contents_open_proj_abs` and the bank witness).  Every declaration depends only
on `propext`, `Classical.choice` and `Quot.sound`, except:
* `contents_open_proj` / `contents_open_proj_abs` / `coreInputBus_abs`, which
  inherit `GuardSrc`/`Bridge.Glue`'s pre-existing `bv_decide` certificates;
* `hostShape_step` (`HostCmd.tagged_step._native.bv_decide.ax_1_22`),
  `stream_rqLd_step` (its own `_native.bv_decide.ax_1_5`),
  `absInv_step`/`absInv_trace` (the two above plus
  `Mem.reqNext_three._native.bv_decide.ax_1_10` from `inv_trace`).
No `sorryAx`, no `Lean.ofReduceBool` of this file's own `decide` lemmas (the
`decide` uses add no axiom).

